{"type":"text","timestamp":1787390956954,"sessionID":"ses_fd733bb11ffeahZWogHTTknbVo","part":{"id":"prt_028cd906e0015ZWBT7tUOl01fs","messageID":"msg_028cd851d0018JZz3qMUfHnr1R","sessionID":"ses_fd733bb11ffeahZWogHTTknbVo","type":"text","text":"Done. `internal/lrucache.js` is now a real bounded LRU:\n\n- `get` marks the key MRU (delete+re-set) and returns the value or `undefined`.\n- `set` returns `this`, skips `undefined` values, and evicts the least-recently-used key when at `max` (1000) — size never exceeds `max`.\n- `delete` returns presence boolean.\n\nThe 5 pre-existing test failures are unrelated (they assert incorrect semver behavior) and unchanged by my edit; parsing answers are unaffected.","time":{"start":1787390955630,"end":1787390956951}}}
